I am currently a Marie Skłodowska-Curie postdoctoral fellow, hosted at the Department of Computer Science, University of Copenhagen, and funded by the European Union (the [https://ec.europa.eu/info/funding-tenders/opportunities/portal/screen/how-to-participate/org-details/999999999/project/101106768/program/43108390/details FairML] project and [https://cordis.europa.eu/project/id/101106768 CORDIS]). 
I am also a member of the [https://www.copenlu.com/ CopeNLU] group led by Prof. [https://isabelleaugenstein.github.io/ Isabelle Augenstein]. Prior to that, 
I obtained my Ph.D. degree from the Department of Computer Science and Technology, University of Science and Technology of China (USTC), and was very fortunate to be supervised by Prof. [http://staff.ustc.edu.cn/~hchen/ Huanhuan Chen]. 
My research interests span the areas of machine learning, ensemble methods, and fairness in machine learning. 
My CV can be found [Yijun_CV.pdf here].


